{"id":"2bc4d1a14a37aabf","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-maximal-fixed-point.md","title":"极大固定点","display":"df-maximal-fixed-point — 极大固定点","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-maximal-fixed-point","aliases":["91-df-maximal-fixed-point","91-df-Kripke-maximal"],"display":"df-maximal-fixed-point — 极大固定点","depends_on":["[[91-df-jump-operator]]","[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-maximal-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-maximal-fixed-point</span><span>91-df-Kripke-maximal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-maximal-fixed-point — 极大固定点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"460308c7099a8386\" href=\"?note=460308c7099a8386\" title=\"91-df-minimal-fixed-point\">91-df-minimal-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-maximal-fixed-point-—-极大固定点-$X_{\\max}$\">df-maximal-fixed-point — 极大固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\max}\">\\(X_{\\max}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (跳跃算子, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> (完整幂集格上的自映射)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 关于包含序单调)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\nX_{\\max}\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{Y\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid Y\\subseteq J(Y)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\nX_{\\max}\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{Y\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid Y\\subseteq J(Y)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\n\\to\n\\left[\nJ(X_{\\max})=X_{\\max}\n\\land\n\\forall Y\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,\n(J(Y)=Y\\to Y\\subseteq X_{\\max})\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\n\\to\n\\left[\nJ(X_{\\max})=X_{\\max}\n\\land\n\\forall Y\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,\n(J(Y)=Y\\to Y\\subseteq X_{\\max})\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\max}\">\\(X_{\\max}\\)</span> : 极大固定点（最大真理集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AllSent}\">\\(\\mathrm{AllSent}\\)</span> : 全句子集（起始全集）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J^n(\\mathrm{AllSent})\">\\(J^n(\\mathrm{AllSent})\\)</span> : 从全集开始的迭代</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\max}\">\\(X_{\\max}\\)</span> 是把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 放在完整格\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 上后由 Knaster–Tarski 得到的代数最大固定点。\n它通常含有真值过剩，未必满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConInfo}\">\\(\\operatorname{ConInfo}\\)</span>，因此不能自动\n称为最大的“一致 Kripke 解释”。</p>\n<p>它可由全集开始作超穷下降迭代：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>层级构造</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_0 = \\mathrm{AllSent}\">\\(Y_0 = \\mathrm{AllSent}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_1\">\\(Y_1\\)</span>删除不满足跳跃条件的句子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_2\">\\(Y_2\\)</span>继续删除，...</li>\n<li><strong>保留悖论部分</strong>：某些悖论句子在极大固定点中可能有真值（不同于极小固定点）</li>\n<li><strong>包含极小</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\min} \\subseteq X_{\\max}\">\\(X_{\\min} \\subseteq X_{\\max}\\)</span>（极小固定点是极大固定点的子集）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>极大固定点的层次：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>第0层</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_0 = \\mathrm{AllSent}\">\\(Y_0 = \\mathrm{AllSent}\\)</span>（所有句子&quot;为真&quot;）</li>\n<li><strong>第1层</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_1 = J(\\mathrm{AllSent})\">\\(Y_1 = J(\\mathrm{AllSent})\\)</span>（删除不满足条件的句子）</li>\n<li><strong>第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>层</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_n = J(Y_{n-1})\">\\(Y_n = J(Y_{n-1})\\)</span></li>\n<li><strong>极限层</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y_\\lambda=\\bigcap_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}Y_\\alpha\">\\(Y_\\lambda=\\bigcap_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}Y_\\alpha\\)</span>，在首次稳定\n的超穷阶段得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\max}\">\\(X_{\\max}\\)</span>；一般不能预先截断在有限阶段。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>固定点的多样性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Kripke跳跃算子<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span>有多个固定点</li>\n<li>极小固定点是&quot;最保守&quot;的选择</li>\n<li>极大固定点是&quot;最扩张&quot;的选择</li>\n<li>存在中间固定点（介于极小和极大之间）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>与真理理论的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>KF理论通常以极小固定点为语义基础</li>\n<li>但其他真理理论可选择不同固定点</li>\n<li>最大代数固定点可能把某句及其否定同时纳入，故不应用来支持\n“可能为真”的模态读法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-maximal-fixed-point-—-极大固定点-$X_{\\max}$","text":"df-maximal-fixed-point — 极大固定点 $X_{\\max}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-minimal-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"460308c7099a8386","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-minimal-fixed-point]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J$ (跳跃算子, see [[91-df-jump-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X_{\\max}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}maximal\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\nX_{\\max}\\coloneqq\\bigcup\\{Y\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\mid Y\\subseteq J(Y)\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mon}_{\\subseteq}(J)\n\\to\n\\left[\nJ(X_{\\max})=X_{\\max}\n\\land\n\\forall Y\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\,\n(J(Y)=Y\\to Y\\subseteq X_{\\max})\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"X_{\\max}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AllSent}","display":false},{"tex":"J^n(\\mathrm{AllSent})","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\max}","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConInfo}","display":false},{"tex":"Y_0 = \\mathrm{AllSent}","display":false},{"tex":"Y_1","display":false},{"tex":"Y_2","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\min} \\subseteq X_{\\max}","display":false},{"tex":"Y_0 = \\mathrm{AllSent}","display":false},{"tex":"Y_1 = J(\\mathrm{AllSent})","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"Y_n = J(Y_{n-1})","display":false},{"tex":"Y_\\lambda=\\bigcap_{\\alpha<\\lambda}Y_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\max}","display":